From 547e4e98668fb85403a34c9cfbb68097cf569cd4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pwtail <abvit89s@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 17:19:27 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 02/10] Add eelang pipelines (block form and inline .. postfix)

---
